 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.7-rc26 — Approvals for staff
+
+- **Approvals tab** (UnderWeb staff): the same queues as Staff on underweb.cloud, right inside UWX — photos & work (with a private preview), hub cards, role applications, VRChat checks and events. Approve or deny in one click; the UnderWeb server still decides what your role is allowed to approve.
+- Your badge now shows your actual UnderWeb role (Owner, Director, Event Staff…) instead of just "UnderWeb staff".
+
 ## 0.6.6-rc25 — Updates for supporters
 
 - **UWX updates now come through your UnderWeb account.** UWX is for UnderWeb's Patreon supporters: the update check asks UnderWeb as you, and UnderWeb only lists releases for active supporters (and staff).
